w concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E34vm1Zv7oUQ7kNvwEsdt_C&_nc_oc=AdkI9OekYa4tmzi1LiVcu1iyv2RMPfUl7gGfViK6tVWpBHw84nMCtZN_hFDrJTc98mE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy_9zMte11vvQE6ICXuM5DkyGEVOAqrZpSs1I5rKXCoCA&oe=69B158AA"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zNovIK4rko0Q7kNvwEWfD6V&_nc_oc=AdnEGmpY0NAnfOAmQ8Uwa4ScuL6aa6U07btUALv9IHnZf2s4sC75pJSBM454N96MYnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwHBML_DN7pdKIUKfbEh4UQHK1NTUq-hcWDcHnLtaDd6g&oe=69B16B5E"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lLrn7xekPzwQ7kNvwGpRUSF&_nc_oc=Adn0Emn2q2OhOUMO547OwWcLoUw4sZnOtjFE7uZCtvvxHJ6q5aJuZS8KRUc1v_ZkudY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfysUrnQBPbseXTAghm_cE-z_y3ti58qy4sfsCzrIoKYqA&oe=69B15A31"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1080_360.png", "id": "9